    {"id":"iku_hira","kana":"いく","romaji":"iku","gloss_en":"to go","tags":["core","k-row","verb"],"worlds":["2-base-hira"],"audio":"","note":"Basic motion verb. Past tense is irregular: いった (itta). Often used with に to mark destination.","example":{"kana":"がっこうにいく","romaji":"gakkou ni iku","english":"to go to school"}},
